# P5 U3-TC: p5-inline-code-retint in a session that claims truecolor
# (COLORTERM=truecolor). fx's builtins are 256-colour at every depth
# (theme.zig:75-159@481104fd; truecolor reaches only the diff markers and the
# Ultra mark, render.zig:98,395) and its switch rewrites bytes, not depths
# (store.zig:3784-3800), so its capture is the 256-colour one. xfx spells
# every grey 38;5 here too, its palette's and the highlighter's alike
# (src/tui/theme.rs Palette, TC-NOTATION), so its capture is its 256-colour
# one as well.
gateway p5-inline-code-retint-turns.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
env COLORTERM=truecolor
wait 4
type show me the code
wait 1
key Enter
wait 8
snap dark
key -H 1b 5b 3f 39 39 37 3b 32 6e
wait 2
snap light
key -H 1b 5b 3f 39 39 37 3b 31 6e
wait 2
snap dark-again
